{"3450920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Remnant Humanity", "steam_appid": 3450920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your crew is running out of oxygen,...</i></strong><i> an alien monster patrols the corridor,... and the cargo is three rooms away. You type the commands - every keystroke costs seconds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remnant Humanity</strong> is a real-time (with pause) salvage game where you type commands to guide your crew through procedurally generated derelict wrecks while trying to help remnant colonies survive. Fly around in your rust bucket, siphon fuel from derelict ships, manage oxygen, dodge radiation, outrun enemies, heal your crew, ... Crew members can die permanently, so know when the risk is about to become too high and you need to abandon the mission. Missions help you and other colonies survive. Can you spare some of the highly requested resources to unlock new ship systems?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450920/extras/e26373ddd813a0547994bc20b1c35d4d.poster.avif?t=1788264386\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450920/extras/e26373ddd813a0547994bc20b1c35d4d.webm?t=1788264386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450920/extras/e26373ddd813a0547994bc20b1c35d4d.mp4?t=1788264386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On AI use:</strong> All artwork, music, and code in this game were created entirely by human hands. No generative AI tools were used at any stage of development.</p>", "a